          "title": "You'll want to know: সংকোচ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সংকোচ — sôngkoch — \"reluctance; bashful hesitation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সংকোচ না করে তোমার প্রশ্নটা জিজ্ঞাসা করো। sôngkoch nā kôre tomār prôshnôṭā jigyāsā kôro. Don't hold back: ask your question."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সংকোচ (sôngkoch) is the shrinking-back of a guest or a newcomer who does not want to impose: সংকোচ (sôngkoch) করবেন না, please don't hold back."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সংকোচ (sôngkoch) is a tatsama, Sanskrit saṃkoca, \"contraction, shrinking together\" (Monier-Williams): shrinking back."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
